5. Check INR/₹ formatting.
6. Check conditional formatting.
7. Check chart titles and labels.
8. Check for incorrect or empty visualizations.
9. Check the overall page layout and visual hierarchy.
10. Fix any errors or inconsistencies.
11. Refine the dashboard to make it look like a professional executive banking dashboard.

